{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "产品工作台 PRD Runtime Result",
  "description": "Read x-workbench-authoring-guide: business-neutral transport fragments only; validation constraints are unchanged.",
  "x-workbench-authoring-guide": {"purpose":"STRUCTURE ONLY, not a complete publishable draft. Replace replace-* IDs and REPLACE_WITH_* text from authorized facts; omit this guide. No business facts, citations, channels, degradation or safety decisions are supplied.","constructionRules":["blocks contains complete objects, never strings, IDs, schema names, $ref or JSON-encoded objects. Put text in typed inline objects with marks: [].","Scope needs a bulletList/orderedList. Each items entry is {id,content}, without type. Never append item IDs or section names as sibling blocks.","Tables require one typed cell per column per row. IDs are globally unique; columnId references a declared column.","sectionFields lists required fields for four sibling objects under content.sections; none belongs inside introduction. Keep every section during repairs.","Copy fixed schema literals verbatim, including all intro characters. JSON \\n decodes to a real newline; never double-escape. TOC punctuation follows the canonical structure reference.","Fragments are incomplete. Replace all markers, retain all required fields, and pass semantic checks. Repair only reported paths and resubmit the complete draft."],"requiredDocumentFields":["protocol","documentId","title","revision","cover","versionHistory","tableOfContents","assumptions","citations","sections"],"sectionFields":{"introduction":["title","background","scope","usageScenarios"],"businessRequirements":["title","summary","pageLinks","coreRules","flowAndPages","acceptanceCriteria"],"degradation":["title","applicable","content"],"safetyBaseline":["title","intro","rows"]},"fixedLiterals":{"content.sections.safetyBaseline.intro":"该部分内容为必填项，请按照如下表格中的内容先进行自查，并按照如下要求完善需求文档：\n1、如选择“是”，代表本项自查内容已符合安全要求，需要提供截图违依据\n2、如选择“否”，代表本项自查内容暂时不符合安全要求，请在需求文档中增加本部分内容安全改造需求，并发送网信安需求评审邮件，附上本需求文档用于安全评审；\n3、如选择“不涉及”，代表本项目各项需求安全基线均不涉及，则无需召开网信安需求评审会。\n建议：该表格请业务人员和开发人员共同参与自查并填写。"},"typedBlockFragments":{"paragraph":{"id":"replace-paragraph-id","type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REPLACE_WITH_TEXT","marks":[]}]},"bulletList":{"id":"replace-list-id","type":"bulletList","items":[{"id":"replace-item-a","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REPLACE_WITH_SCOPE_A","marks":[]}]},{"id":"replace-item-b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REPLACE_WITH_SCOPE_B","marks":[]}]}]},"table":{"id":"replace-table-id","type":"table","columns":[{"id":"replace-column-a","label":"REPLACE_WITH_LABEL_A"},{"id":"replace-column-b","label":"REPLACE_WITH_LABEL_B"}],"rows":[{"id":"replace-row-id","cells":[{"columnId":"replace-column-a","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REPLACE_WITH_CELL_A","marks":[]}]},{"columnId":"replace-column-b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"REPLACE_WITH_CELL_B","marks":[]}]}]}]}}},
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "protocol": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "workbench.runtime.result.v1"
      ]
    },
    "message": {
